# NAV-BACK-DUP - the iOS 26 trigger. Finish the "added" screen with
# "Done for now" (app/syllabus/added.tsx), which used to leave a SECOND tab
# navigator on the root stack, then open/Back 10 times.
# The deep link reproduces the real stack: [(tabs), syllabus/added].
# Today's 'Canvas Sync is already yours' sheet opens 1.2 s after a Today mounts
# (twice per device at most); a fresh tab navigator mounts a fresh Today.
launch
sleep 5
tapif Cerrar/Close
openurl semora://syllabus/added?count=3
sleep 4
scroll 0.7 0.4
sleep 1.5
tap Listo por ahora/Done for now
sleep 3
tapif Cerrar/Close
assert-tabs done-for-now
rootstack after-done-for-now expect=1
tab 5
sleep 1.5
scroll 0.7 0.5
sleep 1
cycle back-after-trigger|10|Configuración/Settings;Carga académica/Workload|1.5
rootstack end expect=1
expect back-after-trigger dead=0
expect back-after-trigger stuck=0
